Lesson IV: Inventory Basics~
@@NTraining crates are stacked around this storeroom to teach item handling before you reach dangerous zones. Pick up the satchel with @@cget satchel@@N, then place items inside it using @@cput <item> satchel@@N to keep your inventory organized. Check your carried gear with @@cinventory@@N or @@cinv@@N, inspect satchel contents with @@clook in satchel@@N, and retrieve items using @@cget <item> satchel@@N. Continue @@rNORTH@@N once you are ready.@@N~
